{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"两员小将意气风发，勇于拼搏，布局短兵相接，中局生龙活虎，残局变化多端。整个棋战双方竭尽抢攻争胜之能事，精彩激烈，妙着迭生，展现了我国年青一代棋手的精神风貌和才华。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8d8","comment":"吕钦以变化多端的“仙人指路”开局，郑伙添以强硬的“卒底炮”应对，布局迅速转变成对攻型的“顺炮直车对横车”，正宜两员勇于拼搏的小将精心角逐，大展身手。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0b0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9a7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h5","comment":"跨河车意在两翼合围封锁，是一种布局趋向。如求稳健，则车二进四巡河亦属可取。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d8d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2b6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g5","comment":"郑伙添底车斩炮换双，既解封锁，又使助线车转占三七路要道，为以后争夺铺下许多伏笔。一个初次进入全国个人赛决赛圈的新手，执黑后走迎战具有前三名水平的大师，在开局阶段构思如此严谨，棋步井然有序，足以显示中局实力。吕钦面临一场恶战，已是势在必然。吕钦如果不愿一车兑双，则第10回合可走车二平八，而吕选择了连冲三路兵进逼对手左翼的战术方案。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2c4","comment":"按一般走法，可走卒7进1兑兵，然后再回车。现在郑伙添抢先回车，矛头指向红马，是一种争先手段。棋战由此以犬牙交错的态势，进入复杂多变的中局搏斗。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g5g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6e5","comment":"中局伊始，仅3个回合就现“空头炮”，掀起激战高潮。第13回合，吕钦可兵三进一，车3平7，兵三进一，车7进2。至此再选择炮五进四或车二进六，另有一番变化，然而他雄劲地回车邀兑，企图形成有车欺无车局面。郑则毫不怯馁，果断地炮击中兵照将，准备吕钦炮五进四，马7进5，车二平七，炮3进3，马三进五，炮3平5。演成炮双马多卒同吕车马抗衡。第14回合，吕不甘局势趋向平淡，宁愿卸中炮卖空头，具见胆识过人。第15回合，郑进中卒保炮，假进车捉炮之势通马，弈来分外精彩。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b6b2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7e7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c1f1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4e3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e5e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e9d9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e7d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a2c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c5e6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a7c8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8i7","comment":"郑伙添镇空头炮后，吕钦镇静从容，先退双车分扼要津，旋即扑马渡河对攻。棋枰上战云密布，剑拔弩张，双方对抢攻势，吕钦于乱军中斩获一象。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4